Z||000002||Jay||05-28-2001||11:04 PM||||Surprised to hear you say you thought Canadian bacon was funny!  Very few Americans got the jokes, at least my friends from down south didn't.  There are alot of Fieros in Canada.  Toronto alone must have thousands!  Our club had over 100 attend it's annual show last year.  You are all invited this year, I believe it will be in September again.  As for excact numbers, I don't really know.  Have to ask GM Canada I guess.<P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR>1986 Northstar GT<BR>www.members.home.net/jaygrande<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/gangster.gif"> ||||reg||1
